{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118158","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118158/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118158/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118158/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118158","id":4200836831,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7P0GIq","number":118158,"title":"Supports longer enet timeouts","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-03T14:38:43Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T08:14:29Z","closed_at":"2026-04-04T15:37:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118158","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118158.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118158.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Support enet longer timeout.\r\n\r\nAs discussed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/14205#discussioncomment-15772907\r\nit was found that the peer would still automatically close after around one minute even though we set the timeout a very large value, making debugging multiplayer game very tedious.\r\n\r\nThe issue stems from the original implementation using a bit‑shift operation `(1 << (outgoingCommand->sendAttempts - 1))` to compare against `peer->timeoutLimit`. This approach unnecessarily complicates the logic and imposes an artificial upper bound on the number of retries (<del>up to 63 attempts on a 64‑bit system, even when the user calls `set_timeout(9223372036854775807, 9223372036854775807, 9223372036854775807)`</del>up to 32 attempts because enet use usigned 32-bit type: `set_timeout(4294967295, 4294967295, 4294967295)`). A simpler and more efficient solution is to directly compare `outgoingCommand->sendAttempts - 1` with `peer->timeoutLimit`.\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\n\r\n- Clarity: The logic becomes straightforward and easier to understand.\r\n- Performance: Eliminates the overhead of bit-shift operations.\r\n- No Limitations: Removes the artificial cap on retry attempts imposed by bit-shift operation.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118158/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}